{"overview":"دانش‌آموزی به نام «نیشیمیا شوکو» که از اختلال شنوایی رنج می‌برد، به یک مدرسه جدید منتقل می‌شود؛ جائی که همکلاسی‌هایش، مخصوصاً یکی از آن‌ها به نام «ایشیدا» به او زورگویی می‌کنند. زمانی که «نیشیمیا» مجبور می‌شود دوباره به مدرسه دیگری برود، «ایشیدا» که خودش را مقصر این کار می‌داند دچار عذاب وجدان می‌شود و ...","tagline":"","overview_en":"Shouya Ishida starts bullying the new girl in class, Shouko Nishimiya, because she is deaf. But as the teasing continues, the rest of the class starts to turn on Shouya for his lack of compassion. When they leave elementary school, Shouko and Shouya do not speak to each other again... until an older, wiser Shouya, tormented by his past behaviour, decides he must see Shouko once more. He wants to atone for his sins, but is it already too late...?","tagline_en":"Sometimes the answer is as simple as learning to listen.","runtime":130,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["山田尚子"],"crew_en":["Naoko Yamada"],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"入野自由","role":"Shouya Ishida (voice)","photo":"/8qEEhHUObNvGQr4e6eqLu5z4qTz.jpg","en":"Miyu Irino"},{"name":"سائوری هایامی","role":"Shouko Nishimiya (voice)","photo":"/gLv9lO7dlUbIsmyJUvgegqAAXki.jpg","en":"Saori Hayami"},{"name":"悠木碧","role":"Yuzuru Nishimiya (voice)","photo":"/a5Mkd66GV1l3c9bZZtnvjUf33T2.jpg","en":"Aoi Yuuki"},{"name":"小野賢章","role":"Tomohiro Nagatsuka (voice)","photo":"/wUYJ3HIeygHfh4rAqupE4RPoG3W.jpg","en":"Kensho Ono"},{"name":"金子有希","role":"Naoka Ueno (voice)","photo":"/pqbqe4CxC6t94ptUW2tJfK5j2J2.jpg","en":"Yuki Kaneko"},{"name":"石川由依","role":"Miyoko Sahara (voice)","photo":"/zptGIN1iklKJL1xrfHKOpxR2qJ9.jpg","en":"Yui Ishikawa"},{"name":"潘めぐみ","role":"Miki Kawai (voice)","photo":"/cwnwrPg1YvB19TbfouC4ShGPmbQ.jpg","en":"Megumi Han"},{"name":"豊永利行","role":"Satoshi Mashiba (voice)","photo":"/duhxGjWjgo6WagvGgKu529ztz7u.jpg","en":"Toshiyuki Toyonaga"},{"name":"松岡茉優","role":"Shouya Ishida as an Elementary School Boy (voice)","photo":"/f7Pn68PjbhbsgwdAcQ7